  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The HR diagram shows two stars, X and Y.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Three statements are made about star X and star Y.</p>\n<p>I.    Star X is hotter than star Y.</p>\n<p>II.   Star X has a larger radius than star Y.</p>\n<p>III.  Star X is more luminous than star Y.</p>\n<p>Which of the statements are correct?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">I and II only</li><li data-label=\"B\">I and III only</li><li data-label=\"C\">II and III only</li><li data-label=\"D\">I, II and III</li></ol>"
  },
